    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Fintan Cahill Auctioneers are delighted to present this immaculate detached bungalow to the market, occupying an elevated c. 0.8-acre site and offering spacious, versatile accommodation in a beautifully maintained family home. Boasting a 'B' BER rating, the property combines modern energy efficiency with stylish, comfortable living in a peaceful countryside setting.\nUpon entering, the front door opens directly into a welcoming sitting room, where an attractive open fireplace creates a warm focal point while a feature staircase leads to the first-floor. Just off the sitting room is a bedroom, currently being used as a home office. A hallway to the right leads to two more generously proportioned ground-floor bedrooms, one of which benefits from a modern en-suite bathroom.\nAt the heart of the home is a bright and spacious kitchen/dining room, providing an ideal space for everyday family life and entertaining. A separate utility room offers excellent practicality, while a second living room provides additional family space and opens onto a superb hardwood deck, expertly crafted from larch timber, creating the perfect setting for outdoor dining, entertaining, or simply enjoying the surrounding gardens. A contemporary family bathroom, finished with modern sanitary ware, completes the ground-floor accommodation.\nThe first floor comprises two generously proportioned rooms, including one with a stylish en-suite bathroom and walk-in storage, offering flexible space to suit a variety of lifestyle needs.\nThe property has been meticulously maintained and thoughtfully upgraded in recent years. In 2025, all ceiling lighting was professionally rewired and fitted with modern energy-efficient light fittings throughout. \nExternally, the property is set on an elevated site with forestry planted at the entrance, creating a natural approach and offering a sense of privacy. The gardens provide generous outdoor space with plenty of room to enjoy the surrounding area. The fully wired pump house has been used as a home office in the past, providing valuable additional space and flexibility.\nOffering an exceptional combination of generous accommodation, quality finishes, modern energy efficiency, and a tranquil setting, this turnkey residence is ideally suited to family living. Viewing is highly recommended to fully appreciate the quality and lifestyle this outstanding home has to offer.\n\nFeatures:\nElevated c. 0.80 acre site\nPresented in pristine condition\nTastefully decorated throughout\n'B' BER rating\nCeiling lights rewired and fitted with energy efficient light fittings in 2025\nHardwood larch deck\nPumphouse/garden shed fully wired\nBioCycle\nWell water\nOil fired central heating"
      },
